          "book": "JOS",
          "chapter": 3,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "Behold, the ark of the covenant of the Lord of all the earth passes over before you into the Jordan.",
      "ko": "보라 온 땅의 주의 언약궤가 너희 앞서 요단으로 들어가나니",
      "source_text_hash": "4a041fea4ec657b81cafb12757a7245586832625fe945b6c6c21fe530a035fc2",
      "translation_text_hash": "eb73cad9d88502c84df5efef0d94808dee5d1be308ce67cd0d3f76e081d1d308",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
